        "Risen from his grave, John limps and runs crooked on a twisted left foot, frozen in the posture of his death in \"The Last Enemy That Shall Be Destroyed\". He straightens up as soon as he draws. The hat of the Undead Cowboy Outfit reveals a bullet hole above his right eye, which is not there with the bareheaded Undead Hunter Outfit. In multiplayer, the \"Liars and Cheats\" pack adds John as a playable model, and \"Undead Nightmare\" adds Zombie Marston.",
